(text "- Only RX and TX need it: they carry the PZEM's 5V signals.\n- S0-S3 go straight from the ESP32 (3.3V is read as HIGH by the\n  74HC4067; it switches near half of VCC). If a PZEM ever reads\n  the wrong channel, add a 2nd converter on S0-S3." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 165.1 274.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "34c99a20-c79d-49ec-84a5-e9cb0187360d"))
